# ============================================================
# The catalog is BUILD OUTPUT, not source.
#
# It is generated by scripts/build_catalog.py and published
# straight to GitHub Pages as an artifact. It is deliberately
# not tracked: when it was, every contributor's next push
# conflicted on a machine-generated file.
#
# Run the build locally any time to preview -- the result just
# won't be committed.
# ============================================================
/index.html
